WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.200
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:40.470 --> 00:41.920
The last ingredient

3
00:42.880 --> 00:44.480
is the Soul-Severing Ginseng.

4
00:44.480 --> 00:45.990
The veins of it

5
00:46.470 --> 00:48.530
perfectly match the lines on my palm.

6
00:49.150 --> 00:51.920
If your hand slips even slightly when you cut it,

7
00:53.000 --> 00:55.470
the ginseng's poison will kill you first.

8
01:07.090 --> 01:08.200
Back then, when I was in Jianghuai,

9
01:08.200 --> 01:10.170
I set up a simple scam.

10
01:10.789 --> 01:12.070
But I never expected

11
01:12.840 --> 01:14.170
the knockout drug I used

12
01:15.400 --> 01:16.870
to be switched for poison.

13
01:19.120 --> 01:20.050
What do you mean?

14
01:23.750 --> 01:25.350
That's how your whole family

15
01:27.120 --> 01:29.250
was wrongfully accused and suffered.

16
01:35.280 --> 01:36.920
I remember I told you

17
01:38.560 --> 01:39.950
who set it up.

18
01:40.120 --> 01:41.070
What is it again?

19
01:42.610 --> 01:43.539
Zhang Dancheng.

20
01:44.680 --> 01:45.120
Right,

21
01:46.280 --> 01:47.210
Zhang Dancheng.

22
01:51.960 --> 01:53.200
I am Zhang Dancheng.

23
01:55.120 --> 01:56.680
Your last enemy.

24
02:02.210 --> 02:02.840
Mentor,

25
02:05.350 --> 02:06.460
are you kidding?

26
02:07.840 --> 02:09.570
I'm just telling you the truth.

27
02:11.680 --> 02:13.310
You can't be soft-hearted

28
02:14.120 --> 02:16.250
when dealing with the Tianxiang Sect.

29
02:16.710 --> 02:17.840
Being soft-hearted

30
02:19.590 --> 02:21.280
will get you killed.

31
02:39.030 --> 02:40.710
So you found me

32
02:42.630 --> 02:43.540
and taught me

33
02:44.360 --> 02:45.400
just to use me

34
02:45.400 --> 02:47.800
to kill the Sect Master to avenge yourself?

35
02:49.480 --> 02:50.230
Exactly.

36
02:51.910 --> 02:52.680
Exactly.

37
02:54.310 --> 02:55.280
When we met

38
02:56.310 --> 02:57.470
8 years ago,

39
02:58.550 --> 03:00.320
this day was bound to come.

40
03:07.590 --> 03:08.680
When I'm gone,

41
03:09.120 --> 03:10.520
you must remember

42
03:11.030 --> 03:12.280
how to walk

43
03:13.340 --> 03:14.200
the road ahead.

44
03:58.680 --> 03:59.610
Zhang Dancheng.

45
04:02.870 --> 04:04.470
After I kill the Sect Master,

46
04:08.110 --> 04:10.080
I'll come back for your life.

47
04:11.130 --> 04:11.970
OK.

48
04:13.080 --> 04:13.750
OK.

49
04:16.600 --> 04:18.130
Your training is complete.

50
04:19.570 --> 04:20.839
It's time to set out.

51
04:22.560 --> 04:23.870
But remember,

52
04:25.360 --> 04:26.620
there's only one thing

53
04:27.240 --> 04:28.680
that never changes.

54
04:30.920 --> 04:32.320
The people closest to you

55
04:33.430 --> 04:34.040
are

56
04:36.360 --> 04:37.190
the most...

57
04:39.120 --> 04:40.360
the most dangerous.

58
04:41.470 --> 04:42.730
The knife is in my hand.

59
04:44.880 --> 04:46.320
I know how to use it.

60
04:51.630 --> 04:52.830
Mentor.

61
07:26.620 --> 07:30.150
[A Prophet]

62
07:31.190 --> 07:33.400
[Episode 6]

63
07:44.040 --> 07:45.480
How should I address you?

64
07:46.490 --> 07:47.850
You don't remember me?

65
07:50.150 --> 07:51.150
That makes sense.

66
07:51.610 --> 07:53.670
You've seen plenty of people like me.

67
07:54.330 --> 07:55.940
It's normal that you don't remember me.

68
07:55.940 --> 07:57.540
I definitely remember those

69
07:57.890 --> 07:59.490
who perform with me on stage.

70
07:59.860 --> 08:01.390
But there are so many people

71
08:01.770 --> 08:03.300
in the audience,

72
08:04.060 --> 08:05.740
so how could I possibly remember them all?

73
08:05.740 --> 08:06.450
My

74
08:07.860 --> 08:08.720
surname is Lyu.

75
08:09.740 --> 08:10.860
Lyu Ruhui.

76
08:13.130 --> 08:14.500
Lyu Ruhui?

77
08:15.250 --> 08:16.850
Miss Jiang remembers me now?

78
08:18.940 --> 08:21.060
Hui—when darkness reaches its deepest, light is born.

79
08:21.060 --> 08:22.210
That's a good name.

80
08:23.210 --> 08:24.860
Judging by your outfit,

81
08:25.450 --> 08:26.330
what line

82
08:27.010 --> 08:28.250
of work are you in?

83
08:29.540 --> 08:30.470
Corpse Driving.

84
08:30.980 --> 08:33.039
If you've mastered corpse-driving,

85
08:33.330 --> 08:34.570
surely you can

86
08:35.610 --> 08:37.140
read fortunes too, Mr. Lyu.

87
08:37.299 --> 08:38.429
I know a thing or two.

88
08:39.059 --> 08:40.850
Then could I trouble you

89
08:41.380 --> 08:42.299
to read

90
08:44.570 --> 08:45.690
my palm?

91
09:05.780 --> 09:07.970
Miss Jiang, you're blessed with good fortune.

92
09:07.970 --> 09:09.450
Your financial luck is good,

93
09:09.450 --> 09:10.810
and your romantic luck is strong, too.

94
09:10.810 --> 09:13.010
But you have too many crossroads ahead.

95
09:13.210 --> 09:15.340
I'm afraid you won't live much longer.

96
09:16.900 --> 09:17.900
Are you serious,

97
09:17.970 --> 09:18.730
Mr. Lyu?

98
09:20.810 --> 09:22.180
Absolutely.

99
09:24.380 --> 09:26.240
There are so many people outside.

100
09:26.310 --> 09:27.420
I advise you

101
09:28.250 --> 09:29.520
not to be impulsive.

102
09:29.900 --> 09:30.610
What?

103
09:31.450 --> 09:34.090
Do you think my fortune-telling is inaccurate?

104
09:34.090 --> 09:35.220
No, you got it right.

105
09:36.330 --> 09:37.450
But in my opinion,

106
09:37.940 --> 09:38.850
Mr. Lyu,

107
09:39.180 --> 09:40.380
you missed one thing.

108
09:42.610 --> 09:43.730
What did I miss?

109
09:45.810 --> 09:47.270
I bring luck to my husband.

110
09:47.810 --> 09:49.540
Bringing luck to your husband?

111
09:49.690 --> 09:51.420
You must be joking, Miss Jiang.

112
09:51.780 --> 09:54.310
Are you sure you're not a jinx to your husband?

113
09:54.420 --> 09:55.810
If I were a jinx,

114
09:56.380 --> 09:57.260
sir,

115
09:57.900 --> 10:00.430
how are you still sitting here safe and sound?

116
10:02.540 --> 10:04.740
You even have the army at your disposal.

117
10:05.300 --> 10:06.260
Miss Jiang,

118
10:07.210 --> 10:08.300
it's been 8 years,

119
10:09.260 --> 10:11.520
and you've certainly risen in the world.

120
10:13.380 --> 10:15.710
Whether I've risen or not doesn't matter.

121
10:16.010 --> 10:17.740
What matters is, you've fallen

122
10:18.060 --> 10:18.660
so low that

123
10:18.660 --> 10:20.790
even a dog can take a bite out of you now.

124
10:23.330 --> 10:24.610
Then please tell me,

125
10:25.570 --> 10:26.330
is this dog

126
10:27.180 --> 10:28.450
blind

127
10:28.900 --> 10:29.900
or not?

128
10:35.380 --> 10:36.980
I think you're the blind one.

129
10:38.970 --> 10:41.540
You don't even know whose corpses you're transporting.

130
10:41.540 --> 10:43.270
Corpse Driving is just a cover.

131
10:44.420 --> 10:46.020
It's actually opium inside.

132
10:46.130 --> 10:47.730
Commander Feng

133
10:47.960 --> 10:50.160
has always hated opium like the plague.

134
10:51.060 --> 10:52.690
If he finds out

135
10:53.490 --> 10:56.780
you're using his fallen soldiers' bodies to smuggle opium,

136
10:56.780 --> 10:58.240
what do you think he'll do?

137
11:00.180 --> 11:01.260
Now you finally know

138
11:01.260 --> 11:02.330
why Blind Du

139
11:02.900 --> 11:04.760
let you drive the corpses, right?

140
11:05.810 --> 11:07.870
If you don't want to be his scapegoat,

141
11:07.970 --> 11:08.970
just play along

142
11:10.140 --> 11:11.380
with me in this act.

143
11:15.210 --> 11:17.730
You'd better think this through, Miss Jiang.

144
11:17.730 --> 11:18.930
When this act is over,

145
11:19.090 --> 11:20.150
if I'm still alive,

146
11:22.570 --> 11:23.610
you will be dead.

147
11:28.820 --> 11:30.750
Let's see if you can survive first.

148
11:32.880 --> 11:34.140
Why are you helping me?

149
11:48.730 --> 11:49.850
You're

150
11:49.850 --> 11:52.250
accusing my regiment colonel and adjutant

151
11:52.330 --> 11:55.530
of using my fallen soldiers' corpses to transport opium.

152
11:56.400 --> 11:59.000
If it were anyone else, they'd already be dead.

153
11:59.260 --> 12:01.140
But why are you still alive?

154
12:01.850 --> 12:03.910
Please see clearly, Commander Feng.

155
12:11.610 --> 12:14.140
What's your relationship with Jiang Feiyan?

156
12:18.090 --> 12:19.810
She's just an old friend of mine.

157
12:19.810 --> 12:21.210
You don't want to tell me?

158
12:29.940 --> 12:31.070
What happened today

159
12:31.310 --> 12:33.420
is bound to put them on their guard.

160
12:35.310 --> 12:37.500
If I can't catch them red-handed,

161
12:38.210 --> 12:40.540
I won't be able to answer to the Commander.

162
12:40.540 --> 12:42.270
Rest assured, Commander Feng.

163
12:43.450 --> 12:45.450
I can make sure you catch them all,

164
12:46.090 --> 12:47.350
leaving no loose ends.

165
12:50.380 --> 12:51.310
Tell me about it.

166
12:52.420 --> 12:53.090
Kill me.

167
13:04.490 --> 13:05.970
Being able to wipe out these scumbags

168
13:05.970 --> 13:07.450
so thoroughly this time,

169
13:07.780 --> 13:09.190
I really have to thank you

170
13:10.020 --> 13:11.620
and that old friend of yours.

171
13:11.850 --> 13:12.730
Old friend?

172
13:14.780 --> 13:15.940
He told you that?

173
13:16.450 --> 13:18.450
He's not really an old friend, is he?

174
13:19.660 --> 13:20.300
Yes.

175
13:21.330 --> 13:22.390
He's an old friend.

176
13:27.540 --> 13:29.870
Why aren't you drinking, Commander Feng?

177
13:30.020 --> 13:31.730
Something's on your mind again?

178
13:31.730 --> 13:32.810
What's on my mind?

179
13:35.180 --> 13:36.330
There are too many scumbags

180
13:36.330 --> 13:39.140
like Lei San in this world. That weighs on me.

181
13:39.490 --> 13:42.060
And the higher-ups deliberately won't let me wipe out

182
13:42.060 --> 13:44.020
those damn swindlers in Longxuya.

183
13:44.020 --> 13:45.450
That weighs on me, too.

184
13:46.120 --> 13:48.430
Commander Feng, you care deeply about your country,

185
13:48.430 --> 13:50.090
and you have lofty ambitions.

186
13:50.340 --> 13:51.530
It's just

187
13:52.090 --> 13:53.750
that the time is not right yet.

188
13:54.260 --> 13:55.830
If you trust me,

189
13:56.720 --> 13:58.600
I hope I can help you

190
13:59.060 --> 14:00.580
realize your ambitions.

191
14:46.790 --> 14:48.590
Aren't you afraid I poisoned it?

192
14:49.390 --> 14:51.080
Death is death. No matter

193
14:51.260 --> 14:52.730
who kills me or how.

194
14:53.660 --> 14:55.590
At least I'll die on a full stomach.

195
14:55.730 --> 14:56.790
It's not a bad deal.

196
14:58.330 --> 15:00.130
You really take death in stride.

197
15:01.300 --> 15:02.090
Kid,

198
15:02.260 --> 15:04.060
since you brought me this meal,

199
15:04.610 --> 15:06.670
I'll read your fortune one more time.

200
15:08.690 --> 15:10.940
By the Nanxi River,

201
15:12.380 --> 15:15.450
against the current, the corpses go.

202
15:23.210 --> 15:23.900
Kid,

203
15:24.180 --> 15:27.180
from the first day you came looking for me at Longxuya,

204
15:28.530 --> 15:30.340
I knew who you were.

205
15:31.660 --> 15:32.570
You haven't

206
15:32.570 --> 15:34.940
changed much in 8 years.

207
15:35.730 --> 15:37.160
If you recognized me,

208
15:39.690 --> 15:40.940
why didn't you kill me?

209
15:40.940 --> 15:42.600
Killing you would be too easy.

210
15:43.300 --> 15:44.380
I kept you alive

211
15:44.480 --> 15:46.630
to draw out the person behind you.

212
15:57.090 --> 15:58.900
Three Yin converge to summon misfortune.

213
15:58.900 --> 16:00.570
Time to close the net.

214
16:00.970 --> 16:01.900
Zhang Dancheng,

215
16:01.900 --> 16:03.170
I know you're there.

216
16:04.490 --> 16:06.220
We were once fellow disciples.

217
16:06.560 --> 16:08.320
Let me tell you something.

218
16:08.970 --> 16:10.890
About what happened with the Wang family back then,

219
16:10.890 --> 16:12.800
you thought I had set you up.

220
16:13.030 --> 16:14.220
It was the Sect Master

221
16:14.220 --> 16:17.560
who had the Qian family replace the knockout drops with poison.

222
16:17.560 --> 16:19.890
He wanted you to be the one to kill.

223
16:20.380 --> 16:21.810
Didn't you live by the rules

224
16:21.810 --> 16:23.630
and refuse to break them even if it meant death?

225
16:23.630 --> 16:26.200
So he used your own rules to destroy you.

226
16:26.780 --> 16:27.780
To put it bluntly,

227
16:28.080 --> 16:29.150
neither of us

228
16:29.170 --> 16:31.410
can escape the Sect Master's grasp.

229
16:31.850 --> 16:33.580
We're both pawns he discarded.

230
16:40.970 --> 16:42.260
This wine

231
16:42.330 --> 16:45.570
tastes like the drug the Qian family used back then.

232
16:46.550 --> 16:48.000
It's quite bitter.

233
16:58.670 --> 16:59.380
Fine.

234
17:00.260 --> 17:01.020
Kid,

235
17:01.330 --> 17:02.450
for this wine,

236
17:02.740 --> 17:05.339
I'll read your Mentor's fortune one more time.

237
17:29.970 --> 17:31.490
Kan means danger.

238
17:32.140 --> 17:33.870
The Lake over Water—hardship.

239
17:34.580 --> 17:36.180
The fourth line is changing.

240
17:37.620 --> 17:39.490
Your fate is trapped by stone,

241
17:40.490 --> 17:42.690
and your soul clings to moss.

242
17:44.530 --> 17:45.660
Zhang Dancheng,

243
17:45.820 --> 17:47.770
your fate is worse than mine.

244
17:48.290 --> 17:50.290
You'll die a worse death than I will!

245
17:56.810 --> 17:58.810
You've read fortunes all your life.

246
17:59.830 --> 18:01.790
Did you foresee dying here today?

247
18:02.290 --> 18:05.250
I read life, not death.

248
18:06.380 --> 18:08.820
I read other people's fates, not my own.

249
18:20.860 --> 18:23.120
I've pretended to be blind my whole life.

250
18:25.420 --> 18:27.530
Now I really can't see.

251
20:23.420 --> 20:26.340
I came from the mortal realm to practice physiognomy.

252
20:26.340 --> 20:29.100
Everything in the mortal world is already in the past.

253
20:29.100 --> 20:31.730
Thunder may strike, and fire may burn, but the wind cannot be driven away.

254
20:31.730 --> 20:34.930
In life and death, it's all within the art of physiognomy.

255
20:39.210 --> 20:40.290
Nobody moves!

256
20:40.970 --> 20:41.970
Nobody moves!

257
21:27.290 --> 21:29.770
[Longxuya]

258
21:28.450 --> 21:30.050
I joined the army at sixteen.

259
21:30.380 --> 21:33.210
I've fought my way through piles of corpses to get where I am today.

260
21:33.210 --> 21:34.540
I don't believe in fate.

261
21:37.450 --> 21:38.780
I only believe in my gun.

262
21:50.380 --> 21:51.040
Commander,

263
21:51.210 --> 21:52.100
the remnants of Longxuya

264
21:52.100 --> 21:53.100
have all been arrested.

265
21:53.100 --> 21:53.960
Those who dared to resist

266
21:53.960 --> 21:55.160
were shot on the spot.

267
22:16.620 --> 22:17.420
You stay here.

268
22:17.580 --> 22:18.110
Yes, sir.

269
22:32.250 --> 22:33.940
Blind Du died last night.

270
22:34.530 --> 22:36.140
I heard

271
22:39.620 --> 22:40.950
you two met before that.

272
22:42.970 --> 22:43.730
If the higher-ups come asking,

273
22:43.730 --> 22:44.900
I'll need an answer.

274
22:46.720 --> 22:48.980
I might have to borrow your life for that.

275
22:52.640 --> 22:53.960
Commander Feng

276
22:54.490 --> 22:56.020
never leaves a root behind.

277
22:56.360 --> 22:57.490
But you should know,

278
22:58.010 --> 22:58.940
I'm not the root

279
22:59.050 --> 22:59.860
of this.

280
23:00.820 --> 23:02.080
Killing me won't help.

281
23:02.620 --> 23:03.900
Then where is the root?

282
23:26.250 --> 23:27.100
Spare me, sir!

283
23:27.140 --> 23:27.730
We're all

284
23:27.900 --> 23:29.100
in the same business.

285
23:29.320 --> 23:30.230
What happened?

286
23:38.100 --> 23:38.770
Liang,

287
23:40.180 --> 23:41.180
I toast to you.

288
23:41.210 --> 23:41.690
Come on.

289
23:47.620 --> 23:48.450
Fill it up.

290
23:49.770 --> 23:50.420
Come on.

291
23:53.970 --> 23:54.900
Liang,

292
23:56.010 --> 23:58.010
thanks for taking care of me lately.

293
23:58.660 --> 23:59.970
Take this money.

294
24:01.620 --> 24:02.750
We're parting ways.

295
24:03.970 --> 24:04.580
What?

296
24:05.380 --> 24:06.510
You said something?

297
24:07.530 --> 24:08.860
We're not parting ways.

298
24:12.210 --> 24:14.610
The road I'm taking next is very dangerous.

299
24:16.100 --> 24:18.050
It'll only make things harder if I take you with me.

300
24:18.050 --> 24:19.210
If it's dangerous,

301
24:19.530 --> 24:20.770
then you need me with you even more.

302
24:20.770 --> 24:23.100
Don't you know what I'm capable of?

303
24:57.580 --> 24:58.660
They call me

304
24:59.490 --> 25:00.140
Tongbei

305
25:00.730 --> 25:01.730
Little Spinning Top.

306
25:01.730 --> 25:02.420
Alright.

307
25:02.420 --> 25:03.660
Liang,

308
25:03.730 --> 25:05.140
I know you're capable.

309
25:05.250 --> 25:05.900
Sit down.

310
25:05.900 --> 25:06.580
Now you know, right?

311
25:06.580 --> 25:06.940
Sit.

312
25:13.210 --> 25:15.870
You saw what happened to the people in Longxuya.

313
25:16.530 --> 25:17.210
Liang,

314
25:19.690 --> 25:21.690
being a swindler can get you killed.

315
25:25.100 --> 25:26.360
I don't want you to die.

316
25:28.580 --> 25:29.530
But my parents

317
25:30.010 --> 25:31.380
weren't swindlers.

318
25:32.090 --> 25:33.290
Why did they both die?

319
25:39.210 --> 25:41.010
Anyway, in this world,

320
25:41.580 --> 25:42.640
just staying alive

321
25:42.660 --> 25:43.580
isn't easy.

322
25:44.490 --> 25:45.580
If it's not easy,

323
25:47.140 --> 25:48.800
shouldn't we try to live well?

324
25:52.940 --> 25:53.900
Listen to me,

325
25:54.660 --> 25:56.120
leave the Tianxiang Sect.

326
25:56.770 --> 25:57.770
Their people

327
25:58.940 --> 26:00.100
never end up well.

328
26:02.490 --> 26:04.690
Aren't we both from the Tianxiang Sect?

329
26:05.450 --> 26:07.450
Then look at what they've done to us.

330
26:07.580 --> 26:08.510
What did they do?

331
26:09.250 --> 26:10.940
They made us scapegoats.

332
26:12.420 --> 26:13.420
That's exactly

333
26:13.490 --> 26:14.940
why I have to follow you!

334
26:15.690 --> 26:16.620
You're capable,

335
26:16.620 --> 26:18.450
and you won't use me as a scapegoat.

336
26:18.450 --> 26:19.450
I'm telling you, bro,

337
26:19.450 --> 26:20.450
whatever you do from now on,

338
26:20.450 --> 26:21.580
I'm coming with you.

339
26:24.660 --> 26:26.860
What if I wanted to kill the Sect Master?

340
26:32.250 --> 26:33.240
Don't talk nonsense.

341
26:33.240 --> 26:33.860
Ruhui.

342
26:33.890 --> 26:35.490
You don't have what it takes.

343
26:39.450 --> 26:40.180
Liang,

344
26:42.820 --> 26:44.420
my real name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

345
26:48.770 --> 26:50.570
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

346
27:02.550 --> 27:05.030
I'm not the root of this.

347
27:05.830 --> 27:07.110
Killing me won't help.

348
27:07.580 --> 27:09.010
Then where is the root?

349
27:09.970 --> 27:10.940
The true root

350
27:11.610 --> 27:13.040
is the buyer behind it all—

351
27:12.720 --> 27:14.700
[Mingcao Hall]

352
27:13.490 --> 27:14.430
the Qian family

353
27:14.940 --> 27:15.870
of Mingcao Hall.

354
27:31.250 --> 27:31.690
Sir,

355
27:31.970 --> 27:33.420
what herbs are you looking for?

356
27:33.420 --> 27:34.480
I'm just browsing.

357
27:37.580 --> 27:40.110
I hear this mountain has plenty of fine herbs.

358
27:43.940 --> 27:44.450
Sir,

359
27:44.770 --> 27:46.210
you must be from out of town.

360
27:46.210 --> 27:47.940
Most of the purple dendrobium

361
27:48.050 --> 27:49.980
you see on the market comes from us.

362
27:50.730 --> 27:51.790
Purple dendrobium

363
27:51.970 --> 27:53.970
is worth its weight in gold these days.

364
27:53.970 --> 27:55.100
You have it in stock?

365
27:55.250 --> 27:56.050
Just a moment.

366
28:08.010 --> 28:09.070
Please take a look.

367
28:16.530 --> 28:17.860
It's indeed excellent.

368
28:18.820 --> 28:20.420
How much are you looking for?

369
28:21.820 --> 28:22.950
How much do you have?

370
28:24.180 --> 28:24.940
We have

371
28:25.140 --> 28:26.250
about 100 jins in stock.

372
28:26.250 --> 28:27.310
Can you take it all?

373
28:35.380 --> 28:36.580
I came from Nanyang.

374
28:36.770 --> 28:37.580
I'm planning

375
28:37.690 --> 28:39.380
to buy a batch of good medicinal herbs to take back.

376
28:39.380 --> 28:41.040
If your herbs are good enough,

377
28:41.050 --> 28:43.050
we can establish a long-term partnership

378
28:43.050 --> 28:45.110
and do business together regularly.

379
28:45.820 --> 28:47.350
Let's talk somewhere else.

380
28:49.380 --> 28:49.970
Bro,

381
28:50.420 --> 28:53.580
a thousand cups of wine are never enough with a true friend.

382
28:53.580 --> 28:55.380
I really feel a connection with you.

383
28:55.380 --> 28:56.140
I wonder

384
28:56.690 --> 28:58.210
if these three gold bars

385
28:58.450 --> 29:00.250
can make up for some of the goodwill

386
29:00.250 --> 29:01.980
you have earned with your wife.

387
29:02.210 --> 29:02.820
Bro,

388
29:04.010 --> 29:05.410
let me tell you the truth.

389
29:05.620 --> 29:06.660
Three gold bars

390
29:06.820 --> 29:07.860
are indeed

391
29:08.140 --> 29:09.530
a lot of money to me.

392
29:10.690 --> 29:11.450
But

393
29:11.900 --> 29:13.530
to my wife's family,

394
29:14.100 --> 29:15.180
it's just a drop

395
29:15.580 --> 29:16.530
in the bucket.

396
29:19.140 --> 29:21.870
I traveled all the way from Nanyang to your place,

397
29:22.490 --> 29:23.660
not for

398
29:23.730 --> 29:25.390
a small deal of a few gold bars.

399
29:26.970 --> 29:27.900
What I want

400
29:30.010 --> 29:31.580
is the bucket.

401
29:34.940 --> 29:36.730
And what exactly is this "bucket"

402
29:36.730 --> 29:39.250
you're talking about, Chengming?

403
29:47.380 --> 29:49.290
The Qian family's Bashen Powder.

404
29:56.820 --> 29:57.450
My friend,

405
29:57.450 --> 29:58.510
don't joke around.

406
29:58.620 --> 29:59.480
The Qian family

407
29:59.530 --> 30:01.190
has been practicing medicine

408
30:01.580 --> 30:03.100
and dealing in herbs for generations.

409
30:03.100 --> 30:04.530
We've never had anything to do

410
30:04.530 --> 30:05.900
with the stuff you mentioned.

411
30:05.900 --> 30:07.010
I heard

412
30:07.660 --> 30:10.620
the Qian family's supply routes have run into some trouble.

413
30:10.620 --> 30:12.480
You can't get the raw materials in

414
30:12.690 --> 30:14.220
and can't get the goods out.

415
30:18.490 --> 30:19.580
I can

416
30:20.420 --> 30:23.280
not only keep supplying the Qian family with opium,

417
30:23.380 --> 30:25.580
but also sell Bashen Powder in Nanyang.

418
30:25.690 --> 30:27.100
With goods coming in and going out,

419
30:27.100 --> 30:29.960
you'll solve the Qian family's immediate problem.

420
30:30.620 --> 30:32.340
And you'll definitely be able to stand tall

421
30:32.340 --> 30:33.540
in front of your wife.

422
30:33.900 --> 30:35.380
You came prepared.

423
30:35.490 --> 30:37.010
Of course.

424
30:37.340 --> 30:39.200
Wenxin, you always keep your word

425
30:39.380 --> 30:41.110
and never shortchange anyone.

426
30:41.730 --> 30:44.450
Liuwei Dihuang pills have honey in them.

427
30:44.450 --> 30:47.180
When they come into contact with water, their surface becomes sticky.

428
30:47.180 --> 30:49.580
But the surface of your pills is dry and hard.

429
30:49.580 --> 30:52.100
These are pills made with white sugar, right?

430
30:52.100 --> 30:53.820
The prescriptions passed down from our ancestors

431
30:53.820 --> 30:55.100
must be followed exactly.

432
30:55.100 --> 30:56.380
The Qian family's reputation over the years

433
30:56.380 --> 30:58.730
has been built up bit by bit by you, Wenxin.

434
31:00.530 --> 31:02.390
I came all this way to do business.

435
31:02.620 --> 31:04.180
If I didn't come to you,

436
31:04.490 --> 31:06.290
wouldn't I be going out of my way?

437
31:06.730 --> 31:08.530
It's nothing worth mentioning.

438
31:14.210 --> 31:15.580
Looking at your face,

439
31:16.100 --> 31:17.290
you have a broad forehead

440
31:17.290 --> 31:18.890
and a prominent nose bridge.

441
31:18.970 --> 31:21.030
It's clearly a face of great fortune.

442
31:21.180 --> 31:22.580
If I'm not mistaken,

443
31:22.940 --> 31:23.900
Wenxin,

444
31:24.250 --> 31:26.690
you are the real source of the Qian family's wealth.

445
31:26.690 --> 31:29.010
My friend, you really know how to read people.

446
31:29.010 --> 31:31.050
My wife believes in this deeply.

447
31:31.050 --> 31:33.380
She has hired many masters to read my face.

448
31:33.660 --> 31:34.530
They all said

449
31:34.900 --> 31:36.300
that I would bring wealth

450
31:37.140 --> 31:38.140
to the Qian family.

451
31:38.140 --> 31:41.010
And now I'm here, bringing you more wealth.

452
31:41.580 --> 31:43.250
If we join forces,

453
31:43.380 --> 31:45.980
once Bashen Powder starts selling in Nanyang,

454
31:46.100 --> 31:47.050
you won't

455
31:48.180 --> 31:50.510
have to answer to the Qian family anymore.

456
31:54.970 --> 31:56.140
Bashen Powder

457
31:56.970 --> 31:58.180
isn't mine to decide.

458
32:04.660 --> 32:06.590
Whether it's honey or white sugar,

459
32:06.770 --> 32:08.290
it's only a minor ingredient.

460
32:08.290 --> 32:09.690
It won't affect the efficacy.

461
32:09.690 --> 32:10.900
You changed the prescription without authorization.

462
32:10.900 --> 32:12.580
How do you know it won't affect the medicine?

463
32:12.580 --> 32:14.440
The Second Master approved this.

464
32:20.140 --> 32:21.010
It seems

465
32:23.300 --> 32:25.120
the son-in-law is still an outsider.

466
32:25.120 --> 32:26.280
Bashen Powder

467
32:27.290 --> 32:29.140
isn't mine to decide alone.

468
32:41.940 --> 32:43.470
We have guests in our house.

469
32:47.010 --> 32:47.730
Liang.

470
32:47.940 --> 32:50.200
No one could pull off this outfit but you.

471
32:51.210 --> 32:52.250
From now on,

472
32:52.530 --> 32:54.450
you are Master Chang Youliang,

473
32:54.450 --> 32:55.770
the 13th-generation successor

474
32:55.770 --> 32:57.250
of Zijin Temple on Mount Heyun.

475
32:57.250 --> 32:59.690
Boundless Heavenly Honor.

476
32:59.730 --> 33:02.050
You really nailed the tone and vibe.

477
33:02.180 --> 33:04.210
With my acting skills,

478
33:04.340 --> 33:06.470
I could make a living on stage for real.

479
33:08.420 --> 33:10.340
Where are we working today?

480
33:10.940 --> 33:11.870
The Qian family.

481
33:12.010 --> 33:12.940
The Qian family?

482
33:13.140 --> 33:13.770
What's their business?

483
33:13.770 --> 33:14.630
Do you remember

484
33:14.690 --> 33:16.350
whose opium we were smuggling

485
33:16.420 --> 33:18.020
when we drove those corpses?

486
33:18.380 --> 33:20.240
Then they are no ordinary family.

487
33:20.660 --> 33:22.140
Then they're no ordinary marks.

488
33:22.140 --> 33:22.620
So,

489
33:22.770 --> 33:24.430
you must promise me one thing.

490
33:25.100 --> 33:26.530
If I sense danger,

491
33:27.010 --> 33:28.690
I'll yell "dumb mark" at you.

492
33:29.530 --> 33:30.590
When that happens,

493
33:30.900 --> 33:31.730
just run

494
33:32.290 --> 33:33.250
and leave me behind.

495
33:33.250 --> 33:33.820
Wait,

496
33:34.620 --> 33:36.290
we're usually the ones who con the marks.

497
33:36.290 --> 33:37.530
Aren't you just insulting me?

498
33:37.530 --> 33:38.590
Pick another word.

499
33:39.820 --> 33:40.970
Sometimes,

500
33:40.970 --> 33:42.210
it's hard to tell

501
33:42.490 --> 33:43.420
who's the prey.

502
33:44.660 --> 33:45.460
Master Chang,

503
33:45.970 --> 33:47.940
this is my husband, Zhou Wenxin.

504
33:48.860 --> 33:50.420
T-This is my wife.

505
33:51.820 --> 33:52.820
What are you waiting for?

506
33:52.820 --> 33:54.750
You want me to serve you a cup of tea?

507
33:54.940 --> 33:56.100
We're not drinking.

508
33:56.230 --> 33:57.230
This way, please.

509
34:04.290 --> 34:05.210
Here.

510
34:07.420 --> 34:08.300
Master Chang,

511
34:08.610 --> 34:09.770
this is my Four Pillars of Destiny.

512
34:09.770 --> 34:11.170
Please take a look.

513
34:11.900 --> 34:13.699
Has something happened at home?

514
34:16.860 --> 34:18.420
I took a quick look.

515
34:19.380 --> 34:21.610
Something is off about the courtyard's layout.

516
34:21.610 --> 34:22.739
If I'm not mistaken,

517
34:23.010 --> 34:24.940
the wealth position has been compromised.

518
34:24.940 --> 34:26.489
For merchants,

519
34:26.650 --> 34:29.090
a compromised wealth position can have varying consequences.

520
34:29.090 --> 34:30.900
It could mean losing wealth,

521
34:31.170 --> 34:32.090
or

522
34:32.739 --> 34:34.170
even the destruction of your family.

523
34:34.170 --> 34:35.830
The destruction of my family?

524
34:35.860 --> 34:36.900
Master,

525
34:37.090 --> 34:38.620
is there a solution to this?

526
34:38.860 --> 34:41.050
Since ancient times, power and wealth have been inseparable.

527
34:41.050 --> 34:42.420
A damaged wealth position

528
34:42.420 --> 34:45.219
can only be resolved by someone

529
34:45.530 --> 34:46.900
with military power.

530
34:48.010 --> 34:49.530
Military power....

531
34:49.820 --> 34:51.610
You mean someone in the military?

532
34:51.610 --> 34:53.380
Where am I supposed to find

533
34:53.610 --> 34:54.780
such a person?

534
34:54.900 --> 34:56.650
Looking at your Four Pillars of Destiny,

535
34:56.650 --> 34:59.860
you should have close ties to someone

536
35:00.010 --> 35:01.340
of considerable rank and influence.

537
35:01.340 --> 35:02.130
Pay

538
35:02.260 --> 35:04.860
more attention to the people around you recently.

539
35:04.860 --> 35:05.780
There should be

540
35:05.860 --> 35:07.940
a benefactor who can help you.

541
35:09.010 --> 35:09.780
Master,

542
35:10.130 --> 35:10.900
could you give me

543
35:10.900 --> 35:12.010
a few more hints?

544
35:17.050 --> 35:19.420
When hardship ends, fortune will return in time.

545
35:19.420 --> 35:21.950
A noble benefactor will soon cross your path.

546
35:21.970 --> 35:24.500
When Dragon and Tiger clash in the mountains,

547
35:24.820 --> 35:27.780
the reckless will eventually encounter the worthy.

548
35:28.050 --> 35:29.610
The first half

549
35:30.170 --> 35:31.420
means

550
35:31.570 --> 35:32.740
a benefactor

551
35:32.860 --> 35:34.340
will appear soon.

552
35:35.380 --> 35:36.700
But the second half—

553
35:36.780 --> 35:38.700
"When Dragon and Tiger clash in the mountains,

554
35:38.700 --> 35:42.260
the reckless will eventually encounter the worthy" means...

555
35:42.740 --> 35:44.140
The time isn't right yet.

556
35:44.380 --> 35:45.380
Give it a few days,

557
35:45.740 --> 35:47.050
and you'll see.

558
36:00.050 --> 36:00.610
Honey,

559
36:01.170 --> 36:02.340
I had some wine.

560
36:02.530 --> 36:03.380
I won't keep you from resting.

561
36:03.380 --> 36:04.910
I'll sleep in the side room.

562
36:06.900 --> 36:09.700
Since when did you start drinking Western liquor?

563
36:11.090 --> 36:12.650
A merchant from Nanyang

564
36:13.050 --> 36:14.580
named Shangguan Chengming

565
36:14.820 --> 36:16.090
wants to do business with us.

566
36:16.090 --> 36:17.340
So I just had a couple of drinks with him.

567
36:17.340 --> 36:18.420
From Nanyang?

568
36:19.340 --> 36:22.070
What business could he possibly discuss with us?

569
36:25.010 --> 36:25.870
Bashen Powder.

570
36:28.130 --> 36:29.060
What did you say?

571
36:30.340 --> 36:32.400
You told him about the Bashen Powder?

572
36:33.170 --> 36:34.130
He brought it up.

573
36:34.220 --> 36:36.130
How would he know if you didn't tell him?

574
36:36.130 --> 36:36.650
I

575
36:37.260 --> 36:37.970
had some wine,

576
36:37.970 --> 36:39.340
and one thing led to another, so I...

577
36:39.340 --> 36:40.670
I ended up admitting it.

578
36:40.740 --> 36:42.820
You just ignore what I said,

579
36:42.820 --> 36:43.610
don't you?

580
36:43.820 --> 36:44.880
Blind Du's hideout

581
36:44.900 --> 36:46.740
was just raided by Commander Feng.

582
36:46.740 --> 36:47.900
If they keep investigating,

583
36:47.900 --> 36:49.780
they'll be coming after us in a matter of days.

584
36:49.780 --> 36:51.380
We should be keeping our heads down right now.

585
36:51.380 --> 36:52.380
And you just had to

586
36:52.450 --> 36:54.250
walk right into the line of fire!

587
36:56.220 --> 36:57.300
Honey,

588
36:58.170 --> 36:59.570
I think Chengming

589
36:59.820 --> 37:01.050
is someone we can trust.

590
37:01.050 --> 37:02.380
The roads are blocked right now,

591
37:02.380 --> 37:03.570
and we can't get the goods out.

592
37:03.570 --> 37:04.780
If we can really sell them

593
37:04.780 --> 37:05.820
to Nanyang as he said,

594
37:05.820 --> 37:07.150
it would be great for us.

595
37:07.530 --> 37:08.650
Nanyang?

596
37:08.820 --> 37:10.970
We can't even get the goods out of the province right now.

597
37:10.970 --> 37:12.170
And have you thought about this?

598
37:12.170 --> 37:13.380
If the Tianxiang Sect

599
37:13.490 --> 37:15.260
finds out about the Bashen Powder,

600
37:15.260 --> 37:17.170
do you think our family will make it out alive?

601
37:17.170 --> 37:19.490
Isn't Blind Du from the Tianxiang Sect?

602
37:19.610 --> 37:20.530
Zhou Wenxin, oh,

603
37:20.530 --> 37:21.340
Zhou Wenxin.

604
37:21.610 --> 37:22.780
Will you ever learn?

605
37:23.010 --> 37:24.820
I've entrusted the family business to you for so many years.

606
37:24.820 --> 37:26.300
Don't you know the rules of the underworld?

607
37:26.300 --> 37:28.900
The Sect Master doesn't allow his men to touch drugs.

608
37:28.900 --> 37:31.220
The Sect Master won't even make money when he could?

609
37:31.220 --> 37:32.480
Can you use your brain?

610
37:32.610 --> 37:33.860
Can the money from running scams

611
37:33.860 --> 37:35.610
really compare to the profits from opium?

612
37:35.610 --> 37:37.130
Isn't the Sect Master's real concern

613
37:37.130 --> 37:38.860
that once his men get involved with opium,

614
37:38.860 --> 37:40.990
they'll grow too powerful to control?

615
37:41.170 --> 37:41.780
Madam,

616
37:41.970 --> 37:43.450
I met Chengming today

617
37:43.780 --> 37:45.740
just to feel him out.

618
37:45.780 --> 37:47.940
He really has nothing to do with the Tianxiang Sect.

619
37:47.940 --> 37:49.130
He came to us

620
37:49.130 --> 37:51.380
with 10 gold bars in hand.

621
37:51.860 --> 37:53.520
If we can really work together

622
37:53.530 --> 37:55.300
and sell the Bashen Powder in Nanyang,

623
37:55.300 --> 37:56.570
no one will be able to stop us.

624
37:56.570 --> 37:58.300
And I think Chengming

625
37:58.650 --> 38:00.650
has powerful connections in both the underworld and the government.

626
38:00.650 --> 38:01.450
You think?

627
38:08.010 --> 38:09.170
He has connections

628
38:10.130 --> 38:10.930
on both sides?

629
38:15.130 --> 38:16.390
How about this, Honey?

630
38:16.420 --> 38:17.420
I'll ask him to come see you

631
38:17.420 --> 38:18.880
in the next couple of days.

632
38:18.940 --> 38:20.470
You should size him up, too.

633
38:27.450 --> 38:28.220
Wait.

634
38:29.700 --> 38:30.780
You forgot again.

635
38:33.970 --> 38:35.010
Incense ash in the same cup;

636
38:35.010 --> 38:36.170
fate on the same slip.

637
38:36.170 --> 38:37.900
Is that what you said before?

638
38:38.490 --> 38:39.620
Say the whole thing.

639
38:49.860 --> 38:50.990
Don't worry, Honey.

640
38:51.050 --> 38:51.940
Incense ash in the same cup;

641
38:51.940 --> 38:53.140
fate on the same slip.

642
38:54.820 --> 38:55.610
You'll sleep

643
38:56.050 --> 38:57.530
in the shrine tonight.

644
38:57.970 --> 38:59.220
Repent to the Buddha.

645
38:59.380 --> 39:00.860
Let him see

646
39:01.530 --> 39:03.260
whether you're truly sincere.

647
39:21.220 --> 39:23.340
Seriously, what's your plan now?

648
39:23.490 --> 39:24.900
She wants someone with military power.

649
39:24.900 --> 39:25.490
Where am I

650
39:25.490 --> 39:27.230
supposed to find someone like that?

651
39:27.230 --> 39:29.830
"Master Chang" can't keep this up much longer.

652
39:31.440 --> 39:32.860
You really are something, aren't you?

653
39:32.860 --> 39:35.260
Too much mutton will give you too much heat.

654
39:36.220 --> 39:37.740
Just tell me straight.

655
39:37.940 --> 39:39.700
What are you really doing at the Qian family?

656
39:39.700 --> 39:40.900
To pick something up.

657
39:41.490 --> 39:42.420
What?

658
39:43.450 --> 39:44.110
The ledger.

659
39:45.420 --> 39:47.950
Are you really going to do business with them?

660
39:49.820 --> 39:51.080
Keep it under control,

661
39:51.300 --> 39:52.260
Master Chang.

662
39:56.330 --> 39:56.930
Take care.

663
40:25.820 --> 40:26.680
Second Master,

664
40:26.970 --> 40:28.430
someone is here to see you.

665
40:29.220 --> 40:30.950
A monk going to a Taoist priest?

666
40:31.420 --> 40:33.020
Something's definitely up.

667
40:48.050 --> 40:49.860
I want to make a deal with you.

668
40:50.220 --> 40:52.220
There's no need for this between us.

669
40:53.260 --> 40:56.530
I know what you need most right now is money to pay your troops.

670
40:56.530 --> 40:57.820
I can help you get it.

671
41:00.780 --> 41:01.490
Please sit.

672
41:04.820 --> 41:06.950
I'm going to the Qian family tomorrow.

673
41:06.970 --> 41:08.260
This time, I'll be going

674
41:08.260 --> 41:09.130
by Jiang Shuyi.

675
41:09.220 --> 41:10.750
You're going there for him?

676
41:12.170 --> 41:13.130
Of course not.

677
41:13.570 --> 41:14.420
From now on,

678
41:14.970 --> 41:16.830
if you need anything in Qianshan,

679
41:18.090 --> 41:19.300
come to me.

680
41:24.260 --> 41:25.660
I just don't understand.

681
41:25.860 --> 41:27.790
If you help me get the military pay,

682
41:29.300 --> 41:30.490
what can I give you?

683
41:32.970 --> 41:34.300
Getting Commander Feng

684
41:34.420 --> 41:36.420
to owe me such a big favor is one thing.

685
41:36.420 --> 41:38.020
I'll have to think carefully

686
41:38.260 --> 41:40.190
about how to collect on it someday.

687
41:46.010 --> 41:46.340
Come.

688
41:46.420 --> 41:47.010
Chengming.

689
41:47.010 --> 41:47.740
Come on.

690
41:47.900 --> 41:48.970
Have a drink.

691
41:49.420 --> 41:51.080
I just like drinking with you.

692
41:54.780 --> 41:55.260
Bro.

693
41:55.900 --> 41:58.100
Didn't we agree to meet your wife today?

694
41:58.340 --> 41:59.390
If we keep drinking like this,

695
41:59.390 --> 42:00.530
we might not be in any shape to meet her.

696
42:00.530 --> 42:01.420
Chengming,

697
42:01.610 --> 42:03.270
there's a saying around here:

698
42:03.780 --> 42:07.490
It's more important to judge the person than the money or the goods.

699
42:07.490 --> 42:08.740
You're a straightforward man.

700
42:08.740 --> 42:09.530
My wife asked me

701
42:09.530 --> 42:10.740
to take good care of you.

702
42:10.740 --> 42:12.470
She will come to meet you later.

703
42:13.380 --> 42:13.820
Here.

704
42:13.820 --> 42:14.900
Eat some food.

705
42:15.930 --> 42:16.420
Try this.

706
42:16.420 --> 42:17.020
Thank you.

707
42:22.010 --> 42:22.860
Chengming,

708
42:24.130 --> 42:25.050
listening to your accent,

709
42:25.050 --> 42:26.570
you're not actually from Nanyang, are you?

710
42:26.570 --> 42:27.740
I was born in Jianghuai

711
42:27.740 --> 42:29.670
and went to Nanyang a few years ago.

712
42:30.260 --> 42:30.780
Well,

713
42:31.530 --> 42:33.340
it seems we are about the same age.

714
42:33.340 --> 42:34.670
What year were you born?

715
42:40.570 --> 42:41.090
Honey.

716
42:46.340 --> 42:47.140
Master Chang,

717
42:47.380 --> 42:49.380
this is a friend's Four Pillars of Destiny.

718
42:49.380 --> 42:50.610
Please read it for me.

719
42:59.740 --> 43:00.530
Chengming.

720
43:01.860 --> 43:02.900
Mr. Chengming,

721
43:03.010 --> 43:04.650
I'm sorry for keeping you waiting.

722
43:04.650 --> 43:05.650
Third Madam Qian,

723
43:05.780 --> 43:06.650
I've heard a great deal about you.

724
43:06.650 --> 43:07.450
It's an honor

725
43:07.530 --> 43:08.530
to meet you today.

726
43:09.130 --> 43:11.130
We drank a bit too much last night.

727
43:11.260 --> 43:12.300
Please don't take it to heart.

728
43:12.300 --> 43:13.420
It's a small matter.

729
43:13.420 --> 43:14.620
Don't worry about it.

730
43:15.010 --> 43:16.420
Please sit down, and let's talk.

731
43:16.420 --> 43:17.340
Sit.

732
43:17.420 --> 43:18.220
Master Chang.

733
43:19.490 --> 43:21.290
Wenxin, pour tea for the guests.

734
43:25.340 --> 43:26.600
Who is this gentleman?

735
43:27.130 --> 43:28.590
I forgot to introduce you.

736
43:28.740 --> 43:30.700
This is Master Chang Youliang,

737
43:30.700 --> 43:32.220
the 13th-generation real person

738
43:32.220 --> 43:34.150
of Zijin Temple on Heyun Mountain.

739
43:34.570 --> 43:35.780
I heard of Master Chang of Zijin Temple

740
43:35.780 --> 43:37.980
on Heyun Mountain when I was in Nanyang.

741
43:38.380 --> 43:39.340
It's truly an honor

742
43:39.340 --> 43:40.340
to meet you today.

743
43:40.450 --> 43:41.260
If there's a chance,

744
43:41.260 --> 43:43.260
I hope you can give me some guidance.

745
43:43.260 --> 43:44.130
You flatter me.

746
43:44.420 --> 43:45.820
I won't hide it from you, sir.

747
43:45.820 --> 43:48.170
We've had some trouble at home recently.

748
43:48.860 --> 43:50.780
So I specially invited the Master down the mountain

749
43:50.780 --> 43:51.910
to take a look for us.

750
43:52.490 --> 43:53.820
May I ask what happened?

751
43:54.170 --> 43:56.030
Is there anything I can help with?

752
43:56.700 --> 43:58.560
Actually, it was a few days ago...

753
44:00.650 --> 44:03.260
This is the finest Pu'er tea we've had this year.

754
44:03.260 --> 44:04.060
Please try it.

755
44:04.260 --> 44:04.740
Okay.

756
44:04.900 --> 44:05.450
Master,

757
44:05.570 --> 44:06.300
please try it, too.

758
44:06.300 --> 44:06.780
Okay.

759
44:13.740 --> 44:14.900
Wenxin told me

760
44:15.220 --> 44:16.450
you had some ideas...

761
44:18.340 --> 44:20.610
about our family business.

762
44:21.220 --> 44:23.280
Why don't you tell me more about them?

763
44:24.860 --> 44:26.940
Since you've gotten straight to the point,

764
44:26.940 --> 44:28.940
I'll get straight to the point, too.

765
44:29.450 --> 44:31.510
I run a shipping business in Nanyang,

766
44:31.650 --> 44:33.380
and I have two shipping routes.

767
44:33.700 --> 44:34.740
My cargo ships

768
44:34.860 --> 44:35.650
make at least

769
44:35.740 --> 44:36.870
9 round trips a week.

770
44:37.130 --> 44:38.780
I'll handle the shipping both ways.

771
44:38.780 --> 44:39.740
We'll split the profits

772
44:39.740 --> 44:41.820
70-30.

773
44:42.220 --> 44:43.220
What do you think,

774
44:43.420 --> 44:44.300
Third Madam?

775
44:46.900 --> 44:48.380
You call the shots at sea.

776
44:50.340 --> 44:51.380
But...

777
44:51.700 --> 44:53.360
we're nowhere near the coast.

778
44:53.450 --> 44:55.300
Getting goods from the mountains to the docks

779
44:55.300 --> 44:56.970
is a real ordeal.

780
44:58.450 --> 45:00.220
I don't know if you

781
45:00.380 --> 45:01.740
has what it takes.

782
45:02.610 --> 45:03.810
Cats have their ways,

783
45:04.050 --> 45:05.250
and dogs have theirs.

784
45:05.260 --> 45:06.740
Since I came all the way here

785
45:06.740 --> 45:08.090
to do business with you,

786
45:08.300 --> 45:09.570
whatever you're worried about

787
45:09.570 --> 45:10.380
is not

788
45:10.900 --> 45:12.010
a problem for me.

789
45:12.780 --> 45:13.780
I'm all ears.

790
45:14.780 --> 45:16.170
It's so lively today.

791
45:18.380 --> 45:19.710
Second Brother is back.

792
45:20.260 --> 45:21.390
We have guests here.

793
45:22.220 --> 45:23.420
Let me introduce you.

794
45:24.090 --> 45:25.970
This is Master Chang Youliang

795
45:26.170 --> 45:27.780
from Zijin Temple on Heyun Mountain.

796
45:27.780 --> 45:28.980
He's from Nanyang...

797
45:29.130 --> 45:30.420
My sister's believed in this sort of thing

798
45:30.420 --> 45:32.010
since she was a child.

799
45:32.410 --> 45:34.610
She considers herself a spiritual practitioner.

800
45:34.610 --> 45:35.700
I think

801
45:36.090 --> 45:38.550
she'll end up becoming a nun sooner or later.

802
45:38.970 --> 45:40.050
Life itself

803
45:40.570 --> 45:42.010
is a cultivation.

804
45:43.380 --> 45:44.900
Well said, Master.

805
45:45.450 --> 45:46.820
There's something

806
45:46.970 --> 45:48.530
I'd like you to read for me.

807
45:49.570 --> 45:50.650
Can you read

808
45:51.010 --> 45:52.140
between the two of us

809
45:53.780 --> 45:54.840
who calls the shots

810
45:55.300 --> 45:56.220
in this family?

811
45:56.700 --> 45:57.630
Second Brother.

812
45:58.490 --> 46:00.260
Since Third Madam has family matters to deal with,

813
46:00.260 --> 46:01.790
I'll come back another day.

814
46:01.900 --> 46:03.360
Don't make it another day.

815
46:03.500 --> 46:05.430
Since the Master won't read for me,

816
46:05.970 --> 46:06.570
then

817
46:07.380 --> 46:08.780
I'll read yours instead.

818
46:11.780 --> 46:13.130
Young man,

819
46:13.820 --> 46:15.420
you have a compound surname,

820
46:15.740 --> 46:16.450
Shangguan.

821
46:17.490 --> 46:19.150
You're Shangguan Chengming,

822
46:19.650 --> 46:20.260
right?

823
46:21.650 --> 46:22.220
Master,

824
46:22.610 --> 46:24.010
was my reading accurate?

825
46:26.490 --> 46:27.420
Do you know

826
46:27.720 --> 46:29.110
how I read it out?

827
46:34.780 --> 46:35.650
Come in.

828
46:52.300 --> 46:53.610
You didn't expect this, did you?

829
46:53.610 --> 46:54.730
I'm still alive.

830
46:58.780 --> 47:01.030
[In the next episode]

831
47:01.170 --> 47:02.130
Miss Shuyi.

832
47:02.700 --> 47:03.570
Come in.

833
47:03.710 --> 47:04.910
Sect Master asked you

834
47:05.860 --> 47:06.990
when you would do it.

835
47:10.650 --> 47:11.440
Today.

836
47:17.000 --> 47:18.060
Second Madam Qian.

837
47:19.010 --> 47:21.010
You didn't invite me to the wedding?

838
47:21.940 --> 47:23.460
Let me introduce her.

839
47:24.160 --> 47:24.950
This is

840
47:25.050 --> 47:26.650
the woman I'm about to marry,

841
47:27.010 --> 47:27.780
Jiang Shuyi.

842
47:27.810 --> 47:30.170
I've only just met Mr. Chengming.

843
47:30.730 --> 47:31.980
Why would I have invited you?

844
47:31.980 --> 47:34.750
Whether you invited me or not, I'm here now.

845
47:35.420 --> 47:37.420
I just wonder whether this marriage

846
47:37.420 --> 47:38.940
is real or not.
